title: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 3 of 4, 'Clinical documentation')
intro: Step 3 is one page: a drop bar and the import row, one checklist card with a clinical summary and a document list, and, as the last section, Authorization preparation (the agents' run). The required documents come from the payer's saved list for the level of care. What a request of this type usually carries is labelled 'Typical for ...', never as a payer's rule. Nothing here blocks: the checklist shows what is missing, and Review & submit lists it again with a fix.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Continue to Clinical documentation' on Eligibility & Benefits\nOr click step 3 in the stepper"
start s2 "Click 'Continue' on a draft row in Authorizations (In progress)\nwhose agents have not started"
screen sc "Clinical documentation\nNo sentence under the title\nHeader button 'Use sample chart'"

group gPage "The page"
  screen dz "Drop bar 'Drop the chart, the insurance card and any documents, or click to choose'\nUnder it: 'Pull from EMR', 'Import a file', 'Paste a screenshot'"
  screen pr "Progress line\n'3 of 4 ready' with a bar and '1 to go', or 'Nothing is missing'\nPill 'Required documents are in' while an optional one is still open\n'Privacy mode' with an info tip"
  screen gc "CLINICAL SUMMARY\n'Diagnoses (ICD-10)' (Recommended), 'Reason for the request' (Recommended)"
  screen gd "DOCUMENTS · SUMMIT, with '7 of 9'\nRequired first, then recommended, then typical for the type, then any file not on the list\nAn empty row has no sentence under it"
  screen prep "Last section: 'Authorization preparation'\nwith 'Start the agents'"
  process pPay "A case Payers redrafted after a payer change shows one line\n'Updated for a payer change on 10/20'"
  screen ft "Bar at the bottom, always in view\n'Back', 'Save as draft'\n'Continue to Review & submit' once all ten agents are done"
endgroup

goto g41 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Drop files and let Reader sort them"
goto g45 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Bring notes in from the EMR, a file or a screenshot"
goto g42 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Required and typical documents by type"
goto g43 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Clinical summary and document rows"
goto g44 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Replace a document or mark it not available"

process pCount "'N of M ready' counts the required documents and the typical ones for the type\nA document marked not available counts as ready: the person dealt with it\nRecommended documents are not counted"
process pStep "The step reads Needs attention · 'N required documents to add'\nor Pending · 'Agents not started' with everything in"

group gBtn "Buttons"
  click cBack "Click 'Back'"
  process pBack "Back to Eligibility & Benefits\nThe draft is kept"
  click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
  click cStart "Click 'Start the agents' in Authorization preparation"
  overlay oConf "Start the agents?\nJ.M., Residential 3.5 · Summit Medicaid HMO\n'8 of 9 documents ready'\n'Missing: Therapy note from the last 14 days' when one is"
  click cCancel "Click 'Cancel', press Escape, or click outside"
  click cGo "Click 'Start the agents'"
  click cRev "Click 'Continue to Review & submit'"
endgroup
goto gSave "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Save as draft and leave"
goto gAgents "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › Start the run and watch it"
goto gElig "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization"
goto gRev "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › The draft and the summary"
endx eNo "Nothing starts"

s1 --> sc
s2 --> sc
sc --> dz --> pr --> gc --> gd --> prep --> ft
sc --> pPay
dz --> g41
dz --> g45
gc --> g43
gd --> g43
gd --> g44
gd --> g42
pr --> pCount --> pStep
ft --> cBack --> pBack --> gElig
ft --> cSave --> gSave
prep --> cStart --> oConf
oConf --> cCancel --> eNo
oConf --> cGo --> gAgents
ft --> cRev --> gRev
